{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In real life, there are many jigsaw enthusiasts who, for various reasons, can\u2019t complete a puzzle. Pieceful Gallery is a game that fully simulates the classic jigsaw experience: use your mouse to organize and rotate puzzle pieces, then assemble the entire image in the traditional way. There\u2019s no space limitation, progress is saved automatically, and levels range from easy to difficult. Come try it for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>\u00b7 Faithfully replicates the operation and challenge of a classic jigsaw\u2014easy to learn and use<br>\u00b7 Each level features a high-definition work of art, allowing you to appreciate masterpieces as you play<br>\u00b7 Puzzle sizes increase from 100 to 1,000 pieces, suitable for beginners or seasoned players of any age<br>\u00b7 Relaxing background music to soothe your mind while you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(All art used in the game is in the public domain.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794810?t=1756905532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794810/d61c7e219e32c27fa96576e7ffa222cd2844a0c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756905532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794810/71e36d49c27bfa2e2985bff201ba0b68a0356505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756905532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794810/71e36d49c27bfa2e2985bff201ba0b68a0356505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756905532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In real life, there are many jigsaw enthusiasts who, for various reasons, can\u2019t complete a puzzle. Pieceful Gallery is a game that fully simulates the classic jigsaw experience: use your mouse to organize and rotate puzzle pieces, then assemble the entire image in the traditional way. There\u2019s no space limitation, progress is saved automatically, and levels range from easy to difficult. Come try it for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>\u00b7 Faithfully replicates the operation and challenge of a classic jigsaw\u2014easy to learn and use<br>\u00b7 Each level features a high-definition work of art, allowing you to appreciate masterpieces as you play<br>\u00b7 Puzzle sizes increase from 100 to 1,000 pieces, suitable for beginners or seasoned players of any age<br>\u00b7 Relaxing background music to soothe your mind while you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(All art used in the game is in the public domain.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Catnip studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794810/be813af699e7d4b5a65c81f352d784d540979587/header.jpg?t=1756905532","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794810/1049847436/705edf14f7ceb82b05c539ede23ca21283ebe4d3/1756903520/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756905530","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794810/1049847436/705edf14f7ceb82b05c539ede23ca21283ebe4d3/1756903520/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756905530","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794810/1049847436/705edf14f7ceb82b05c539ede23ca21283ebe4d3/1756903520/hls_264_ma